#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:5
#: 46573b81e3de4952aadc181b6b1e7282
msgid "Holybro H-RTK F9P GNSS"
msgstr "Holybro H-RTK F9P GNSS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:11
#: e36489c17d7a477b9f875a10c416afc2
msgid ""
"The `Holybro H-RTK F9P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-f9p/>`_ is"
" an multi-band high-precision RTK GPS series by Holybro. This system "
"provides multi-band RTK with fast convergence times and reliable "
"performance, concurrent reception of GPS, GLONASS, Galileo and BeiDou, and "
"fast update rate for highly dynamic and high volume applications with "
"centimeter-accuracy. It uses a UBLOX F9P module, an IST8310 compass, and a "
"tri-colored NTF LED indicator. It also has a integrated safety switch for "
"simple and convenient operation."
msgstr ""
"`Holybro H-RTK F9P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-f9p/>`_ 是 "
"Holybro 推出的多频段高精度 RTK GPS 系列产品。该系统提供多频段 RTK，具备快速收敛时间和可靠性能，可同时接收 "
"GPS、GLONASS、Galileo 和北斗信号，适用于对精度要求极高的高动态、大量应用，定位精度可达厘米级。它使用 UBLOX F9P "
"模块、IST8310 罗盘和三色 NTF LED 指示灯，并集成了安全开关，操作简便。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:13
#: 30b5903a1bee41b4bf0403a0666f0849
msgid ""
"Using RTK allows ArduPilot to get its position with centimeter-level "
"accuracy, which is much more accurate than can be provided by a normal GPS."
msgstr "使用 RTK 可使 ArduPilot 获得厘米级定位精度，远优于普通 GPS 所能提供的精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:15
#: 6c7a1a813fa34eb7b07088eadac3f698
msgid ""
"There are three models of Holybro H-RTK F9P to choose from, each with "
"different antenna design to meet different needs:"
msgstr "Holybro H-RTK F9P 有三种型号可供选择，每种型号的天线设计不同，以满足不同需求："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:22
#: cf4554a67c804fe6a860c3a2af5242c6
msgid "Pin Map"
msgstr "引脚图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:29
#: 8673fa26cbcb4a03bfa5954eb7785802
msgid "Wiring and Connections"
msgstr "接线与连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:31
#: 108f64e3f8c9476cbe1656aea2834f03
msgid ""
"All H-RTK GNSS models come with a GH 10-pin connector/cable that is "
"compatible with the Pixhawk family and many other autopilots."
msgstr "所有 H-RTK GNSS 型号均配备 GH 10 针连接器/线缆，与 Pixhawk 系列及众多其他飞控兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:33
#: bd4d49d5519643edbbf3bb912fcba9b6
msgid ""
"The cables/connectors may be modified to connect to other autopilot boards, "
"using the Pin Map information provided above."
msgstr "可根据上方引脚图信息修改线缆/连接器，以连接其他飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:35
#: 3b87bb2983b342c492f5492e4631c64d
msgid ""
"For Pixhawk Cube 2.1 variant that does not come with a 10-way GPS port and "
"hence requires connector re-termination, note that the RX port on the GPS "
"module should feed into the port labelled GPS_RX (TX of autopilot board) on "
"the autopilot board. Also, the GPS1 port is 8-way only, which can be "
"circumvented by leaving 3v3 and buzzer lines out."
msgstr ""
"对于不带 10 针 GPS 端口的 Pixhawk Cube 2.1 变体，需要重新端接连接器。注意 GPS 模块上的 RX 端口应连接到飞控板上标有 "
"GPS_RX（飞控 TX）的端口。此外，GPS1 端口仅为 8 针，可通过省略 3.3V 和蜂鸣器线来解决。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:38
#: 44f2aa43c6e3452eb6b1c01dc535b1b9
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:40
#: 76db6a57a60e4d3eb166d2e675366cb2
msgid ""
"For normal operation, ArduPilot's GPS parameter defaults will work for any "
"serial port configured for ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5."
msgstr "正常使用时，ArduPilot 的 GPS 参数默认值适用于配置为 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5 的任意串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:42
#: 474d62c5cc124cb4ae87ce23c78a69d3
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently configure UBlox F9P GPS constellations. User "
"must assure that the GPS is properly configured for his region and "
"application. See :ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-update`"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 目前不配置 UBlox F9P GPS 星座。用户必须确保 GPS 针对其地区和应用进行了正确配置。请参阅 "
":ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-update`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:44
#: 74705a05ee8e4303a545c928034b5bcf
msgid ""
"If you are unable to preform a normal compass calibration (\"compass "
"dance\") for any reason, then set parameter COMPASS_ORIENT=6 (Yaw270) for "
"proper compass orientation."
msgstr "如果因任何原因无法执行正常罗盘校准（「罗盘舞」），请设置参数 COMPASS_ORIENT=6（Yaw270）以获得正确的罗盘方向。"

